        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5aaf3c36b2894012b2077a32ecd57855",
      "statement": "The access token is pushed into the shared API client with setToken, and the client attaches it as an Authorization Bearer header on every request, so individual call sites never handle authentication.",
